%% HANDWRITTEN. Checked against D120 + api/routers/assist.py + apps/customer_assist/index.html
%% One round trip: the broker stops describing a website and fills it instead.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as ลูกค้า · customer
    participant P as customer_assist<br/>(one static page, polls 1s)
    participant API as ReadyCall API
    participant W as workstation<br/>(React, socket)
    actor B as นายหน้า · broker

    Note over C,B: they are already on a call. The brief is on the broker's screen.

    B->>W: presses ส่งลิงก์
    W->>API: POST /v1/agent/calls/{id}/assist/link
    API-->>W: token + link (idempotent per call)
    B-->>C: reads the link out<br/>(P5 sends it by SMS or LINE)

    C->>P: taps the link
    P->>API: GET /v1/assist/{token}
    API-->>P: tier=guest · call_active=true
    Note over P: the header says กำลังสนทนากับเจ้าหน้าที่<br/>so the page never looks like a stray form

    B->>API: push comparison
    API-->>B: 200
    P->>API: (next poll, ≤1s)
    API-->>P: the comparison
    Note over C: sees their group plan against a top-up,<br/>differences highlighted, both carriers named

    B->>API: push form
    API-->>B: 400 — form needs a signed-in screen
    Note over B: the refusal names the reason,<br/>so the broker asks rather than guesses

    B-->>C: asks them to sign in
    C->>P: signs in
    P->>API: POST /v1/assist/{token}/sign-in
    API-->>P: tier=verified

    B->>API: push form (prefilled with what the broker already knows)
    P->>API: (poll)
    API-->>P: the form
    C->>P: types the rest and submits
    P->>API: POST /v1/assist/{token}/respond
    API-->>P: 200 · the card now says ส่งข้อมูลเรียบร้อยแล้ว

    W->>API: GET /v1/agent/calls/{id}/assist
    API-->>W: responded=true + exactly what they typed
    Note over B: nobody read a field name down a phone line
